  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accompanied Nexus Learning &amp; Analytics for Area C Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The objective is to (i) capture real time learning in the implementation of EU nexus area-based pilot (ii) provide bespoke analysis on Area C to better inform programme design and implementation and (iii) conduct media analysis and identify opportunities/packages for enhanced Area C strategic communications&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
